      "text": "The system sacrificed its champions when key players became unavailable. In response, a coaching change was made—though the hired gun arrived too late. Despite the mid-season replacement coach's efforts, the swept contenders faced an uphill battle. In Game 4, the opportunistic conquerors outmatched the underdog, completing a four-game sweep. The new order prevailed, crushing any rebellion and advancing to the final.",
